# Conformance probe pack for the transform `utf8` in a sequential `bits`
# layout (spec 0.55: valid wherever `ascii` is, at a bit length). Most
# significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   16 bits   probe.s1  utf8 (2 bytes)
#   8 bits    probe.n   uint
format     conformance-utf8-seq
version    0.55.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.s1  16  utf8
field   probe.n   8   uint
